        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Situated within walking distance of Killeagh Village, No. 178 Killeagh Gardens is a 3/4-bedroom detached residence presented in excellent condition throughout. Extending to approximately 110 m², this bright and spacious family home offers well-designed accommodation, a private rear garden and off-street parking, making it an ideal choice for families, first-time buyers or those seeking a property in a convenient East Cork location.\r\n\r\nThe property is ready for immediate occupation and has been well maintained, with generous living accommodation throughout.\r\n\r\nAccommodation\r\nEntrance Hall\r\nA welcoming entrance hall with tiled flooring and useful understairs storage.\r\n\r\nGuest WC\r\nConveniently located off the hallway and fitted with WC and wash hand basin, complete with tiled flooring.\r\n\r\nLiving Room\r\nA beautiful, bright and spacious reception room featuring an open fireplace with cast iron stove. Double doors lead through to the kitchen/dining area, providing excellent flow between the principal living spaces.\r\n\r\nKitchen/Dining Room\r\nA generously proportioned L-shaped kitchen/dining room with tiled flooring throughout. The modern fitted kitchen incorporates a range of integrated appliances and provides ample storage and workspace, while the dining area offers plenty of room for family dining and entertaining.\r\n\r\nStudy / Bedroom No. 4\r\nA versatile ground-floor room which can be utilised as a home office, playroom, study or fourth bedroom, depending on individual requirements.\r\n\r\nFirst Floor\r\nLanding\r\nBright and spacious landing providing access to all first-floor accommodation.\r\n\r\nBedroom No. 1\r\nA generous double bedroom positioned to the front of the property, complete with built-in storage units and mirrored sliderobes.\r\n\r\nEnsuite\r\nFitted with modern sanitary ware, tiled flooring and a fully tiled shower unit.\r\n\r\nBedroom No. 2\r\nA spacious double bedroom overlooking the rear garden and benefiting from built-in wardrobes.\r\n\r\nBedroom No. 3\r\nA comfortable single bedroom located to the rear of the property.\r\n\r\nMain Bathroom\r\nWell-appointed family bathroom finished with full wall and floor tiling.\r\n\r\nOutside\r\nTo the front, the property benefits from its own off-road parking space. The rear of the property enjoys a private enclosed garden, providing an ideal space for outdoor dining, relaxation and family enjoyment. A garden shed offers valuable additional storage.\r\n\r\nLocation\r\nKilleagh is a thriving East Cork village situated on the N25 between Midleton and Youghal, offering a range of everyday amenities including shops, pharmacy, school, cafés and sporting facilities. The picturesque Glenbower Wood is located nearby and provides scenic woodland walks and recreational space.\r\n\r\nThe property enjoys an excellent location within walking distance of the village centre, while Midleton is approximately 15 minutes away by car, offering an extensive range of shopping, educational and leisure facilities. Cork City is within a comfortable 35–40 minute commute, making the property an attractive option for those seeking village living with convenient access to the city.\r\n\r\nNo. 178 Killeagh Gardens presents an opportunity to acquire a spacious family home, combining modern comforts, flexible accommodation and a highly convenient East Cork location."
      },
